WEBVTT

00:01:23.623 --> 00:01:30.623
(Applause)

00:01:30.647 --> 00:01:31.853
No matter where you fall,

00:01:31.877 --> 00:01:34.059
there's a few things
I need you to understand

00:01:34.083 --> 00:01:35.283
before I continue.

00:01:35.869 --> 00:01:38.537
First, we do torture people
here in America,

00:01:38.561 --> 00:01:40.903
tens of thousands of them every day.

00:01:40.927 --> 00:01:43.127
It's called solitary confinement.

00:01:43.513 --> 00:01:45.823
It's done in our names,
using our tax dollars,

00:01:45.847 --> 00:01:47.386
behind closed doors.

00:01:47.902 --> 00:01:49.260
And as a result,

00:01:49.284 --> 00:01:52.427
we're undermining the core values
of our justice system.

00:01:53.477 --> 00:01:55.367
Built with state-of-the-art technology,

00:01:55.391 --> 00:01:58.297
ADX has nearly perfected
solitary confinement.

00:01:58.970 --> 00:02:01.038
Each man spends 23 hours a day